Prompt: "Hey device, tell me a joke."
Steps to process the command: 
    1. Trigger word/wakeword detection
        Audio -> "Hey device?" (0/1) (Y/N)
    2. Speech Recognition
        Audio -> "Tell me a joke" = Input A
    3. Intent Recognition
        Input A: "Tell me a joke."
        Input B: Joke?, Time?, Music?, Call?, Weather?
    4. Execute Joke
 This is an AI pipeline. Where AI completes tasks one after the other

Prompt: "Hey device, set timer for 10 minutes."
Steps to process the command: 
    1. Trigger word/wakeword detection
        Audio -> "Hey device?" (0/1) (Y/N)
    2. Speech Recognition
        Audio -> "set timer for 10 min." = Input A
    3. Intent Recognition
        Input A: "set timer for 10 min." --> timer?
        Input B: timer
    4. Execute
        a. Extract duration
            Set timer for {10 minutes}
            Let me know when {10 minutes} is up
        b. Start Timer for 10 minutes

